      "content": "A CRLF injection vulnerability was present in the website ██████████. This vulnerability occurs when a website or application fails to properly sanitize or encode user-supplied data that contains carriage return and line feed (CRLF) sequences. The attacker can leverage this vulnerability to inject malicious headers or content into the application's responses.",
